# Syntax: docs/LANGUAGE.md. Check with `rbb bid check`.
#
# Wolff sign-off (Rick, 2026-09-30: "there is a convention where 3C there
# is to stop in part score"). After 1x-1y-2NT (18-19), responder's 3C
# asks opener to bid 3D; responder passes with diamonds or signs off in
# his major. Every other call but pass forces to game (game-force.bid).

module wolff "Wolff sign-off after opener's 2NT rebid"
  card   other_conventions.wolff_signoff.play
  needs  base
  skill  bidding_conventions/wolff_signoff

after 1x (P) 1y (P) 2N (P)
  3C  "Wolff: relay to 3♦, to sign off"   alert
      shows points<=6, D>=6 | (y>=6, y is H) | (y>=6, y is S)
      when  y is not C
      sets  ask=wolff
      artificial
      priority 1

when asked wolff
  3D  "Wolff: the forced 3♦"   alert
      artificial

when answered wolff, partner.last=3D
  P   "To play in 3♦"                  shows D>=6
  3y  "To play in {y}"                 shows y>=6
      when  y is H | y is S
